WEBVTT

NOTE
Scene 1 duration in seconds: 39.769999999999996

1
00:00:01.273 --> 00:00:03.393
Welcome to The Teatime Shift.

2
00:00:03.393 --> 00:00:08.129
For the next fifteen minutes you're going to lead a real teatime at a care home, supporting a man called

3
00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:10.843
Daniel through his meal, on your own.

4
00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:13.200
There are no hints and no single right answer.

5
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.253
What happens is whatever your choices make happen.

6
00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:17.681
One important thing before we start.

7
00:00:17.681 --> 00:00:20.363
This simulation is for learning and reflection.

8
00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:25.953
It does not replace or override a person's individual eating, drinking, and swallowing plan.

9
00:00:25.953 --> 00:00:31.283
Nor does it override professional or clinical guidance, your organisation's own policies and procedures,

10
00:00:31.283 --> 00:00:35.883
accredited first-aid training, or the instructions of the emergency services.

11
00:00:35.883 --> 00:00:39.130
When you're ready, acknowledge that below, and begin your shift.
